==Havering council elections since 2022==
There was a revision of ward boundaries in Havering in 2022. The ward gained the [[Hornchurch Marshes]] and [[Frog Island, London|Frog Island]] area that was previously part of the [[South Hornchurch (ward)|South Hornchurch]] ward.
